        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Amybeth McNulty, Lucy Maud Montgomery, Moira Walley-Beckett\n- Products: Anne, Anne with an E, Anne of Green Gables\n- Organizations: CBC, Netflix\n\nFacts:\n- In 1908, Lucy Maud Montgomery published the novel Anne of Green Gables.\n- Anne is a Canadian television series based on Lucy Maud Montgomery's 1908 novel Anne of Green Gables.\n- Moira Walley-Beckett adapted Anne as the series' writer and producer.\n- On Netflix, the series Anne is titled Anne with an E.\n- In 2017, Amybeth McNulty starred as Anne Shirley in the CBC and Netflix series Anne.",
